==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Dirt Cheap}}

==Battleground==
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Two Can]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Tackey]] spawns.
**1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
**3 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
**2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
**5 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

